1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,629
Kuya, sandali—

2
00:00:01,729 --> 00:00:03,602
Ito yata ’yung importante.

3
00:00:03,702 --> 00:00:07,404
Mas importante ’yung biscuits. Pasalubong ’yon.

4
00:00:07,504 --> 00:00:09,914
Ligtas. Walang nasaktan.

5
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:11,425
Ikaw?

6
00:00:11,525 --> 00:00:14,890
Hindi. Kapangalan ko lang na kamukha ko.

7
00:00:14,990 --> 00:00:17,786
Malakas din palang dugo ng diwata rito.

8
00:00:17,886 --> 00:00:20,972
School program. Grade Four. Wala kang nakita.

9
00:00:21,072 --> 00:00:24,372
Anong wala? Ikaw na nga nagsabi.

10
00:00:24,775 --> 00:00:26,426
Lagi kang may dalang tali?

11
00:00:26,526 --> 00:00:30,673
Nag-aayos ako ng bangka. Mas madaling may dala kaysa lumangoy pauwi.

12
00:00:30,773 --> 00:00:31,923
Beauty.

13
00:00:32,023 --> 00:00:32,733
Bagwis.

14
00:00:32,833 --> 00:00:33,951
Totoong pangalan?

15
00:00:34,051 --> 00:00:35,660
Ikaw nga Beauty.

16
00:00:36,650 --> 00:00:39,983
Beauty! Umuwi ka nang hindi nagsasabi?

17
00:00:40,083 --> 00:00:42,105
Gusto ko ngang surprise.

18
00:00:42,205 --> 00:00:44,926
Sa ’kin ka mag-surprise. Hindi sa maleta.

19
00:00:45,650 --> 00:00:49,148
May hatid service ka na pala. Ako, pinagbubuhat mo pa.

20
00:00:49,248 --> 00:00:50,650
May dalawang kamay ka.

21
00:00:51,067 --> 00:00:52,927
Isa na naman?

22
00:00:53,027 --> 00:00:54,864
Fresh kasi kapag araw-araw.

23
00:00:54,964 --> 00:00:57,023
’Yung tinapay o ’yung dahilan?

24
00:00:57,123 --> 00:00:58,713
…dalawa na nga.

25
00:00:59,150 --> 00:01:00,133
Matagal na ’to?

26
00:01:00,233 --> 00:01:03,306
Alin? Panaderya namin? Noon pa.

27
00:01:03,406 --> 00:01:06,246
Kay Tito. Saka ka na magbayad ng kuwento.

28
00:01:06,346 --> 00:01:07,266
Ako na riyan?

29
00:01:07,366 --> 00:01:07,886
Okay na.

30
00:01:10,858 --> 00:01:14,758
Sandali. Dito masakit? Kaya mong igalaw?

31
00:01:14,858 --> 00:01:18,796
Diinan mo muna. Tapos hugasan natin sa gripo.

32
00:01:25,775 --> 00:01:26,527
Nurse ka?

33
00:01:26,627 --> 00:01:29,574
Katatapos lang. Bakit, may ipapatingin ka?

34
00:01:29,674 --> 00:01:32,591
Wala. ’Yung maleta mo lang.

35
00:01:32,691 --> 00:01:34,661
Ikaw ang may specialty diyan.

36
00:01:35,067 --> 00:01:35,812
Saan ka uuwi?

37
00:01:35,912 --> 00:01:38,741
Sa bahay namin sa dulo. Kay Tomas.

38
00:01:38,841 --> 00:01:39,889
Mabigat ba?

39
00:01:39,989 --> 00:01:42,065
Hindi. Tara.

40
00:01:42,483 --> 00:01:45,619
Pa! Bakit hindi mo sinabi na ganito kalaki?

41
00:01:45,719 --> 00:01:47,255
Maliit lang ’yan.

42
00:01:47,355 --> 00:01:50,845
Sa ’yo lahat maliit. Kahit noong bumagsak ’yung bubong.

43
00:01:50,945 --> 00:01:52,244
Hindi buong bubong.

44
00:01:52,344 --> 00:01:53,976
Ako na maglilinis nito mamaya.

45
00:01:54,942 --> 00:01:57,527
Tinulungan niya ako. Nasira ’yung maleta.

46
00:01:57,627 --> 00:01:58,687
Magandang hapon po.

47
00:01:58,787 --> 00:01:59,989
Anong pangalan mo?

48
00:02:00,089 --> 00:02:01,429
Bagwis Dalisay.

49
00:02:01,858 --> 00:02:04,546
Beauty, ipasok mo na ang gamit mo.

50
00:02:04,646 --> 00:02:06,229
Pa, sandali—

51
00:02:06,329 --> 00:02:07,170
Ako na rito.

52
00:02:07,270 --> 00:02:09,158
Sige. Ingat sa biscuits.

53
00:02:10,108 --> 00:02:11,787
Sabi mo nadulas ka.

54
00:02:11,887 --> 00:02:13,265
Sa may palaisdaan.

55
00:02:13,365 --> 00:02:14,343
Saan ka sumabit?

56
00:02:14,443 --> 00:02:15,830
May lumang yero.

57
00:02:16,817 --> 00:02:19,494
Bukas mo na tapusin. Pagod ka.

58
00:02:19,594 --> 00:02:23,931
Pareho kayo. Kapag ayaw sumagot, ako ang pinapatulog.

59
00:02:24,031 --> 00:02:26,731
Masarap sana luto niya ngayong umuwi ka.

60
00:02:27,150 --> 00:02:28,716
Masarap din naman sa ’yo.

61
00:02:28,816 --> 00:02:32,444
…medyo maalat lang dahil excited ka.

62
00:02:42,858 --> 00:02:43,785
Bagwis?

63
00:02:43,885 --> 00:02:46,486
Beauty. Huwag mong buksan.

64
00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:49,115
Anak. Papasukin mo ako.
